v 1.0.0
d 'tmo': Thresholding Multiple Outcomes (TMO) standard error estimator
d 
d Requires: 
d - Stata version 13
d - gtools package (ssc install gtools)
d - Java (optional; the estimator falls back to Mata without it)
d - geodist for legacy distance dyads only (ssc install geodist)
d - compatible SCPC companion for scpc options only (see help tmo)
